Definitely the client.

110
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:13,440
Right.

111
00:05:13,460 --> 00:05:14,620
It forces a broader view.

112
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,340
Exactly.

113
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:18,740
It makes you think beyond just your own desk or your own team.

114
00:05:19,690 --> 00:05:21,770
And the answer in the source material was specific.

115
