Finance is reconciling now, and the client expects revised data before their 2.00 call.

116
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:30,220
Ah, the 2.00 PM call.

117
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:33,080
That sets a very clear, hard deadline.

118
00:05:33,460 --> 00:05:35,410
Creates immediate urgency.

119
00:05:35,450 --> 00:05:35,980
Definitely.

120
00:05:36,060 --> 00:05:37,020
No ambiguity there.

121
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:40,600
Success or failure hinges on hitting that deadline.

122
00:05:40,700 --> 00:05:43,510
So the path forward starts taking shape right away.

123
