Notice they're communicating the plan to fix it even before it's fully fixed.

125
00:05:52,860 --> 00:05:53,520
That's important.

126
00:05:54,080 --> 00:06:00,980
And the individual also commits to calling operations directly to own the miss and outline the temporary containment steps clearly.

127
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:02,120
Own the miss.

128
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:03,860
That phrase keeps coming up.

129
