It really encapsulates this whole first phase, doesn't it?

130
00:06:06,090 --> 00:06:06,770
It's concise.

131
00:06:06,890 --> 00:06:07,500
It's active.

132
00:06:07,510 --> 00:06:10,040
It focuses on fixing things, not making excuses.

133
